# Cargo's output. This crate is its own workspace root, so it has its own.
/target

# Written by `tauri-build` on every build from `tauri.conf.json`,
# `capabilities/` and `permissions/`. Regenerated, never edited.
/gen/schemas

# The mobile projects are *not* ignored: `gen/apple/project.yml`,
# `gen/apple/webbluetooth-browser_iOS/Info.plist`,
# `gen/android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml` and `MainActivity.kt` all
# carry edits without which Bluetooth does not work — see the README. Only
# their build products are.
/gen/apple/Externals
/gen/apple/build
# The Xcode project is generated from `project.yml` by xcodegen, which
# `tauri ios init` runs; `xcodegen generate` inside `gen/apple` recreates it
# from the spec alone. Tracking it would mean tracking two copies of every
# setting, and Xcode writes the developer's own signing team back into it the
# first time the signing tab is opened.
/gen/apple/*.xcodeproj
/gen/apple/*.xcworkspace
# Written by cargo-mobile2/Tauri per machine.
/gen/apple/.tauri
/gen/android/.tauri
/gen/android/.idea
/gen/android/app/build
/gen/android/build
/gen/android/.gradle
/gen/android/app/src/main/jniLibs
/gen/android/app/src/main/assets
